{
  "师兄/师姐，终于到乐寿堂了！师父在手札里留下了三个图案：鹿、鹤，还有一只瓶子。奇怪的是，他没有写地点，只说“庭院里藏着一个太平愿望”。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/3bb97b46f41aa107.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "我们先别急着猜答案。你负责在现场寻找，我来帮你查档案。记住，只在允许游览的区域观察，不要触碰任何陈设。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/c7a44983ae15cc53.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "找到了！这应该是铜鹿。先把这个轮廓记下来。别急着把“鹿”当成答案，它也许只是半句暗语。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/ddd78711e6d6bb1a.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "第二个图案是鹤。鹿、鹤……师父把它们画在同一页，应该不只是因为它们好看。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/b6da2725d33f3877.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "最后一件，是铜花瓶。鹿、鹤、瓶都找齐了！它们放在一起，究竟表达什么？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/7033ec50088fc5e2.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "你刚走近园门，手机里多了一份未署名的档案。封面像被翻过无数次，唯独落款处，干净得反常。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/b982f497d1820043.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "有人说，写下它的匠人在重修后失踪了。可档案里，连他的姓名都找不到。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/5c3464bf3bdfbd75.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "你看，纸页的毛边已经泛黄，署名处却太干净了。像有人特意把“谁写的”留给了后来者。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/c4578b6f0327c8cf.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "我不想再讲一个未经核实的失踪故事。你愿意和我走一遍，看看它到底留下了什么吗？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/b7aa0f653d6068d7.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "站在北如意门外安全区域，观察门额或入口环境。 写下你进入园林时最先注意到的一处细节。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/66a873b3c07b04dc.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "你接住了半本手札。阿衡在目录旁，添上了你的身份。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/4a1fd7551f5e72b0.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "选择你的调查身份，接下这份来历不明的委托。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/c3c1709769f4aead.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "没有标准身份，选你最感兴趣的一种。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/27ae87e0d29eb668.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "身份只改变提示的角度，不会限制路线。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/fa3321ef4ac77fc9.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "三种身份都可以完整体验故事。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/cae5c388e7603531.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "手札上有一句被反复描深的话：“吾避于山腰，不在画中，在画外。”纸页边，画着半截窗框。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/62fedcac9a228d99.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "先别急着数檐角。看看眼前这一层柱檐、林木，再把目光送到湖面。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/7161f8af576ce8c8.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "我原以为这句话是一张藏身图。直到你换了一个角度，才发现它也可以是一种观看的方法。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/0ffd39ff7a9f1a9e.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "如果换一个站位，画面就变了——会不会真正的线索，是“怎么看”，而不是“数多少”？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/efee519557bac096.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "寻找安全观景点，依次观察近处栏檐、中间林木、远处湖山。 记录换一个站位后，画面发生了怎样的变化。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/a18d38312b49ae33.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "你获得了“借景之镜”。镜面映出的，是你开始认真观看的那一刻。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/d0e3550cdb541e37.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "寻找“近景、中景、远景”三层线索，留意视角怎样改变风景。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/33fa6b71af0af86e.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "先找离你最近的一根柱或一道檐。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/c436b80bacefb17c.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "再找中间的树冠与远方的湖面。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/4ff5c2e8e105c602.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "选择同时记录三个层次的观察。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/6ff518ed09c1c67e.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "廊下的光一格一格落在地上。手札背面，忽然显出一行较新的字迹：“你看见的，是风景，还是别人替你选好的答案？”": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/ba2ddd047ebb1e38.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "这一页的笔迹和前面不同。也许我们读到的，早就不止一个人的故事。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/adf47264834ecee8.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "前一页让我们找他，这一页却问你看见了什么。若这些字出自不同的人，那半本空白，会不会正在等待另一个写作者？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/22c1140d08f24785.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "这一次，别替他作答。挑一眼你愿意记住的风景，给它起个名字。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/a81a3ad57bb4114e.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "在长廊开放段挑一个可停留的位置，用柱框或窗景组织画面。 为你的照片写一句理由：为什么愿意记住这一眼？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/4fa11b6299b0a069.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "“廊间画笺”已收入行囊。这一次，手札上留下的是你的字。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/87f1619869109aa8.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "给这一眼风景起个名字；实地游玩时，也可以拍下自己的廊间画面。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/bef344e4cc016671.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "可以写下光线、颜色或一种心情。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/16d333dab22be62a.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "不用寻找官方“标准取景角度”。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/898ba8141cace02e.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "选择任一建议标题，或输入自己的名字。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/c743b4b8d056e1f3.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "一页断札，指向两处宫殿。馆藏摘要里，一个声音断言：“只要看懂这些构件，就能知道匠人当年的秘密行动。”": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/9003739040e7ed55.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "这句话太确定了。一个构件，真的能替一个人的一生作证吗？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/b526538bf717b44b.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "两面宫墙，像两份不同的证词。相同的构件能被讲成不同的故事——这一次，我想听你说：哪些是你看见的，哪些只是我们想相信的。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/6c1dadb92842c115.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "去玉澜堂，或去仁寿殿。我们不赶着判案，先听完两边的说法。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/99a503d13406d985.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "选择玉澜堂或仁寿殿，在允许拍照的公共区域观察构件或殿前陈设。 写下一个你亲眼看见的事实，再补一句尚不能证明的推断。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/b2a9e026aaf40ddc.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "你获得了“留白之印”。有时候，诚实的空白，比笃定的答案更接近真相。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/5d3020f448242721.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "选择一条调查支线，辨别观察与推断之间的距离。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/fb6d14e22b2aacaf.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "先问：这句话描述的是所见，还是人物动机？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/1753c9d35c438a23.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "器物可见，不等于秘密行动已经被证实。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/949652b0b19f0e41.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "选择保留观察、暂缓人物行为推断。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/9eb18fa42d594ded.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "东堤风起，远处佛香阁的轮廓浮在树梢上。手札写着：“第四层见真章。”": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/27a2e3156c2d0d11.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "等等。我们一路都在追数字，可是“层”和“檐”，真是一回事吗？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/52e8ef246c7e196f.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "如果是熟悉这座建筑的匠人，会把三层写成四层吗？也许是后来的人抄错了，也许这本手札从一开始，就不是我们以为的那种档案。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/5b61f523ad6b0ed5.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "我找到一条可核查的官方说明。先把两段话放在一起，再决定哪一句该改。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/1ebcda8e724dcb2a.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "在文昌阁附近安全停留，打开佛香阁官方建筑资料，核对“层”和“檐”。 用自己的话写下：手札的说法错在什么地方？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/9a4efd8a7f456f7d.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "你获得了“重檐校样”。真正破解的，是一道写错的题。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/a23c0e7e346fded1.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "对照官方建筑介绍，找出手札中混用的概念。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/d62464f9c4441c3b.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "官方说明里同时出现了“三”和“四”。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/098591570eaae63f.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "一个描述楼层，一个描述檐。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/67b52ce6349383b6.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "不是四层楼，而是三层四重檐。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/60e1a777409075ce.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "桥影落进湖里。你把手札翻到最后，那里没有逃亡路线，也没有一个等你揭晓的真名。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/11d6c237bf94ca93.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "我一直以为，只要走到终点，就能替那个“失踪的人”找回名字。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/5d49d1656252e589.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "我曾把缺失的名字当作一场失踪的证明。可是，空白本身并不是证据。你一路留下的照片与文字，才是今天真正发生过的故事。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/99e7a3052cb10bba.mp3",
    "mood": "mystery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "可我们找到的，是不同年代的笔迹、被改写的数字，和一个还没有足够证据的传说。也许，真正差点丢失的，是认真看待这座园林的方式。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/62815c5cecc424bd.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "在十七孔桥东岸允许停留处回看湖面、桥影和已收集的信物。 写下这次游玩改变了你对园林的哪一种印象。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/b776a98e41804770.mp3",
    "mood": "companion",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "“桥影留笺”已收好。你走过的这一路，终于有了自己的署名。": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/fa5de720cfe4794a.mp3",
    "mood": "discovery",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "把沿途证据归位，为手札选择一种诚实的结尾。": {
