    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "鹿、鹤、瓶都找齐了。师父为什么把它们放在同一页？": {
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/9f0fb04fb58d44c3.mp3",
