    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/f2d11c08035f4632.mp3",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "画框对齐的瞬间，一条朱线从山楼落向东岸。手札里的“镇水之眼”，原来仍要由真实的景物来作答。": {
    "mood": "companion",
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/814c0ac87c3cdb0b.mp3",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "调整取景框，收进湖水、万寿山与佛香阁，读懂图纸上的视线。": {
    "mood": "companion",
    "src": "/assets/voice/doubao/335723e3bbfd51b4.mp3",
    "provider": "doubao-tts-2.0",
    "speaker": "zh_female_vv_uranus_bigtts"
  },
  "阿衡把师父草图中的木构舱楼与现场照片放在一起。窗、柱、顶，像是被另一个时代重新写过。": {
